{"id":"78d81301-f52d-4cba-a134-a3221d56e824","createdAt":"2026-10-25T05:30:22.234Z","batchId":"login_claude-opus-5-5-subscription_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-opus-5-5-subscription","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"login","prompt":"A login form with email, password, a \"remember me\" option and a sign-in button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"center\" style=\"min-height:80vh;\">\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:400px;\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h1 class=\"h2\">Sign in</h1>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Enter your email and password to access your account.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"login-error\" class=\"alert alert-destructive\" role=\"alert\" hidden></div>\n\n      <form id=\"login-form\" class=\"stack\" novalidate>\n        <label>\n          Email\n          <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" required>\n        </label>\n\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <label>\n            <span class=\"row between\">\n              <span>Password</span>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"small muted\" id=\"forgot-link\">Forgot password?</a>\n            </span>\n            <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" minlength=\"8\" required>\n          </label>\n          <div class=\"row between\">\n            <span class=\"small muted\">At least 8 characters.</span>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" id=\"toggle-password\" aria-controls=\"password\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Show</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"remember\" name=\"remember\">\n          Remember me\n        </label>\n        <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin-top:-0.5rem;\">Stay signed in on this device for 30 days. Avoid on shared computers.</p>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-block btn-lg\" id=\"submit-btn\">Sign in</button>\n      </form>\n\n      <div id=\"login-success\" class=\"alert\" role=\"status\" hidden>\n        <strong>Signed in.</strong> <span id=\"success-detail\"></span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <p class=\"small muted center\">Don't have an account? <a href=\"#\">Create one</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var form = document.getElementById('login-form');\n  var email = document.getElementById('email');\n  var pw = document.getElementById('password');\n  var remember = document.getElementById('remember');\n  var toggle = document.getElementById('toggle-password');\n  var errorBox = document.getElementById('login-error');\n  var successBox = document.getElementById('login-success');\n  var successDetail = document.getElementById('success-detail');\n  var submitBtn = document.getElementById('submit-btn');\n\n  toggle.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    var show = pw.type === 'password';\n    pw.type = show ? 'text' : 'password';\n    toggle.textContent = show ? 'Hide' : 'Show';\n    toggle.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(show));\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('forgot-link').addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    showError(email.value.trim()\n      ? 'If an account exists for ' + email.value.trim() + ', a reset link is on its way.'\n      : 'Enter your email above, then click \"Forgot password?\" to get a reset link.');\n    errorBox.classList.toggle('alert-destructive', !email.value.trim());\n  });\n\n  function showError(msg) {\n    successBox.hidden = true;\n    errorBox.classList.add('alert-destructive');\n    errorBox.textContent = msg;\n    errorBox.hidden = false;\n  }\n\n  form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    errorBox.hidden = true;\n    var v = email.value.trim();\n    if (!v) { showError('Please enter your email address.'); email.focus(); return; }\n    if (!email.checkValidity()) { showError('That email address doesn\\u2019t look right. Check for typos.'); email.focus(); return; }\n    if (!pw.value) { showError('Please enter your password.'); pw.focus(); return; }\n    if (pw.value.length < 8) { showError('Password must be at least 8 characters.'); pw.focus(); return; }\n\n    submitBtn.disabled = true;\n    submitBtn.textContent = 'Signing in\\u2026';\n    setTimeout(function () {\n      submitBtn.disabled = false;\n      submitBtn.textContent = 'Sign in';\n      successDetail.textContent = 'Welcome back, ' + v + '. ' +\n        (remember.checked ? 'You\\u2019ll stay signed in on this device for 30 days.' : 'You\\u2019ll be signed out when you close the browser.');\n      successBox.hidden = false;\n    }, 800);\n  });\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[3024,"<div class=\"page\">"],[3072,"\n  <div class=\"center\" style"],[3122,"=\"min-height:80"],[3173,"vh;\">"],[3227,"\n    <div class=\"card st"],[3274,"ack g"],[3323,"ap-lg\" style=\"width"],[3375,":100%;max-width:"],[3425,"400"],[3475,"px;\">\n      <div class"],[3525,"=\"stack g"],[3576,"ap-sm\">\n        <"],[3628,"h1"],[3678," class=\"h2\">S"],[3729,"ign in</h1>\n        "],[3777,"<p class=\"muted\">"],[3828,"Enter your email and password to access"],[3878," your account.</p>\n      "],[3930,"</div>\n\n      <div id"],[3979,"=\"login"],[4028,"-error"],[4081,"\" class=\"alert alert-"],[4129,"destructive\" role=\"alert"],[4180,"\" hidden></"],[4230,"div>\n\n     